    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d397">

                <pb facs="0718" n="648" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg648"/>

                <head>No. 396.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Morgan to Mr. Frelinghuysen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1883-05-09"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 9, 1883</date>.
                        (Received May 25.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 614.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I transmit herewith the treaty entered into
                    between the Republics of Mexico and Guatemala on the 27th September, 1882, the
                    ratifications <pb facs="0719" n="649" xml:id="pg649"/> of which were exchanged
                    at this capital on the 1st May, 1883, as published Officially in the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Siglo Diez y Nueve</hi> of the 4th instant, together
                    with a translation thereof.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>P. H. MORGAN.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d397-a1.xml" xpointer="d397-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
